id: QUAL-059
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Complex boolean expression (4+ operators — extract to named function)
category: quality
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .jsx .tsx .java .kt .cs .py .go
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
patterns:
  - regex: if\s*\([^)]*&&[^)]*&&[^)]*&&[^)]*&&
    message: "Complex boolean (5+ AND operators) — extract to a named function like isEligibleForDiscount()"
  - regex: if\s*\([^)]*\|\|[^)]*\|\|[^)]*\|\|[^)]*\|\|
    message: "Complex boolean (5+ OR operators) — extract to a named function"
fix: Extract complex conditions to descriptively-named functions. if (isEligible(user)) instead of if (user.age > 18 && user.active && ...).
